### GET all users
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users

### GET user by id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/68d3c3205aa5ac99c91a528c

### DELETE ONE USER
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/68d3c26d5aa5ac99c91a528a

### CREATE ONE USER
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userFirstName": "newUserFN",
  "userLastName": "newUserLN",
  "email": "newUserEmail@gmail.com",
  "password": "11111111",
  "nickname": "newUserNick"
}
### UPDATE ONE USER
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "68d3c28e5aa5ac99c91a528b",
  "userFirstName": "Username",
  "userLastName": "UserLastname",
  "email": "userEmail@gmail.com",
  "password": "11111111",
  "nickname": "UserNick"
}

### GET HELLO USER
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/hello/user

### GET HELLO ADMIN
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/hello/admin

### GET HELLO UNKNOWN
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/hello/unknown
